          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "前から思ってたんです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我一直就挺在意这件事的。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I've been thinking this for a while."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "トランプの定番ゲーム「神経衰弱」"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "扑克牌的经典游戏《神经衰弱》"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The classic playing card game, \"Shinkei-suijaku\" (Concentration)."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "名前めっっっっちゃ怖くないです？？？？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这名字是不是超超超超吓人？？？？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Isn't the name really, really scary????"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "写真はウミウシのぬいぐるみ。週末の中国ライブに向けての買い物をしに行ったのにね、気付いたらウミウシのぬいぐるみ買ってたの。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "照片里是海蛞蝓的玩偶。明明是为了周末的中国演出去买东西的，结果一回过神来，已经买下了海蛞蝓的玩偶。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The photo is a sea slug plushie. I went shopping for this weekend's live in China, and before I knew it, I'd bought a sea slug plushie."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "準備したのは移動中にするつもりのswitchのみ。や、やばい………"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "准备了的只有打算在途中玩的switch。糟、糟糕了………"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All I've prepared is my Switch to play while traveling. Th-this is bad………"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleEn": "🌊🐄"
